IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TESTBINT.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INT-ED PIC -(15)9.99.
COPY "BINTP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Test 1: Simple Accrual (Baseline)
    MOVE "ACCRUE" TO INT-OP
    MOVE 10000.00 TO INT-AMOUNT
    MOVE 1000 TO INT-BPS
    MOVE 30 TO INT-DAYS
    MOVE 360 TO INT-BASIS
    CALL "BINT" USING BK-INT-REQ
    MOVE INT-INTEREST TO WS-INT-ED
    DISPLAY "test=accrue_baseline rc=" INT-RC " interest=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-INT-ED)

    *> Test 2: Daily Compound Interest (Corrected Formula)
    MOVE "COMPOUND" TO INT-OP
    MOVE 10000.00 TO INT-AMOUNT
    MOVE 1000 TO INT-BPS
    MOVE 30 TO INT-DAYS
    MOVE 360 TO INT-BASIS
    CALL "BINT" USING BK-INT-REQ
    MOVE INT-INTEREST TO WS-INT-ED
    DISPLAY "test=compound_daily rc=" INT-RC " interest=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-INT-ED)

    *> Test 3: Compound 365 Days (No Overflow)
    MOVE "COMPOUND" TO INT-OP
    MOVE 10000.00 TO INT-AMOUNT
    MOVE 1200 TO INT-BPS
    MOVE 365 TO INT-DAYS
    MOVE 365 TO INT-BASIS
    CALL "BINT" USING BK-INT-REQ
    MOVE INT-INTEREST TO WS-INT-ED
    DISPLAY "test=compound_365 rc=" INT-RC " interest=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-INT-ED)

    *> Test 4: Invalid Basis Rejection
    MOVE "COMPOUND" TO INT-OP
    MOVE 10000.00 TO INT-AMOUNT
    MOVE 1000 TO INT-BPS
    MOVE 30 TO INT-DAYS
    MOVE 300 TO INT-BASIS
    CALL "BINT" USING BK-INT-REQ
    DISPLAY "test=compound_bad_basis rc=" INT-RC " msg=" FUNCTION TRIM(INT-MSG)

    *> Test 5: Fee Return Propagation
    MOVE "FEE" TO INT-OP
    MOVE 45.50 TO INT-FEE
    CALL "BINT" USING BK-INT-REQ
    MOVE INT-INTEREST TO WS-INT-ED
    DISPLAY "test=fee_propagation rc=" INT-RC " interest=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-INT-ED)

    GOBACK.
